Per-game settings

  * Cyberpunk 2077
     - Go to Steam > right click the game > Properties
     - Under General, put this into Launch Options: gamemoderun %command%
     - Under Compatibility, tick the box and pick: GE-Proton11-3
  * Deadlock
     - Go to Steam > right click the game > Properties
